# Local environment
.env
.env.local

# Aristo runtime artifacts produced by dogfooding the SDK on its own source.
# Downstream projects DO commit these (deterministic + reviewable). This repo
# generates them via `aristo index` / `aristo init` for local validation but
# excludes them from git so the dogfood doesn't churn the tree.
/aristo.toml
/.aristo/
/.github/workflows/aristo.yml
